        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "The largest drill mast variant is the HEMH (Hydraulic Excavator Mount Heavy), intended for excavators weighing around 30 tonnes. For the very largest HEMH models, one of the excavator’s sticks can be replaced by the mast. The excavator can then fit on a single transport."
        },
        {
          "type": "button",
          "kind": "download",
          "text": "Data sheet",
          "href": "/assets/docs/tei-borrmaster-hemh-ladda-ner-pdf.pdf",
